			<div class="content" id="post-content-3776359">
									

<p>This is my first skip. It's a project I've spent a couple of years playing with. Now I finally think it is worthy, so here it is.</p>
<p>Thanks to <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/bear-run" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1766089); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1766089&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1562015467" alt="Bear-run" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1766089)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/bear-run" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1766089); return false;">Bear-run</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/marr965" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(515327); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=515327&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1562015467" alt="Marr965" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=515327)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/marr965" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(515327); return false;">Marr965</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-gates" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3279223); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3279223&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1562015467" alt="Dr_Gates" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3279223)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-gates" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3279223); return false;">Dr_Gates</a></span>, <span class="error-inline"><em>SeptemberJackal</em> does not match any existing user name</span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/stallmantic" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3472766); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3472766&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1562015467" alt="Stallmantic" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3472766)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/stallmantic" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3472766); return false;">Stallmantic</a></span> and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-reach" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1779895); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1779895&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1562015467" alt="Dr Reach" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1779895)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-reach" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1779895); return false;">Dr Reach</a></span> for their critiques, as well all my friends who have given this reviews and writing suggestions.</p>
<p>I'd also like to thank <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-reach" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1779895); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1779895&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1562015467" alt="Dr Reach" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1779895)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-reach" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1779895); return false;">Dr Reach</a></span> and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/communism-will-win" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(617958); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=617958&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1562015467" alt="Communism will win" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=617958)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/communism-will-win" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(617958); return false;">Communism will win</a></span> for allowing me to make reference to to their articles.</p>
<p>Also, since people really wanted it, I've added an interview log to the final version. Hope it provides some satisfying context.</p>
<p>Finally, both images are released under creative commons. Sources are here:<br />
<a href="https://www.pexels.com/photo/backlit-breathing-apparatus-danger-dangerous-279979/">https://www.pexels.com/photo/backlit-breathing-apparatus-danger-dangerous-279979/</a><br />
<a href="http://www.theamazingpics.com/pics/explosive-photo-of-7200-pounds-of-unusable-explosives-are-detonated-near-camp-leatherneck-in-afghanistan">http://www.theamazingpics.com/pics/explosive-photo-of-7200-pounds-of-unusable-explosives-are-detonated-near-camp-leatherneck-in-afghanistan</a></p>
<p>=EDIT 01/07/2019=<br />
